  "YARN-11876": {
    "jira_id": "YARN-11876",
    "issue_type": "Improvement",
    "resolution": "Fixed",
    "title": "Fix AsyncDispatcher crash in TestAppManager",
    "description": "h3. *Description*\r\n\r\nAfter upgrading to {*}JUnit 5{*}, the {{ResourceManager}} module encounters a crash when running unit tests. Specifically, the failure occurs in the test case {{{}TestAppManager#testRMAppSubmitWithQueueChanged{}}}.\r\nDuring application submission, the test changes the queue assignment, which triggers a {{SchedulerEvent}} that the {{AsyncDispatcher}} cannot handle.\r\n\r\nAs a result, the dispatcher thread throws an exception and terminates, causing the test JVM to exit abnormally with a {{{}SurefireBooterForkException{}}}.\r\n\r\n*Error Details*\r\n{code:java}\r\n2025-10-08 07:56:46,833 ERROR [AsyncDispatcher event handler] event.AsyncDispatcher (MarkerIgnoringBase.java:error(159)) - Error in dispatcher thread\r\njava.lang.Exception: No handler registered for class org.apache.hadoop.yarn.server.resourcemanager.scheduler.event.SchedulerEventType\r\n    at org.apache.hadoop.yarn.event.AsyncDispatcher.dispatch(AsyncDispatcher.java:277)\r\n    at org.apache.hadoop.yarn.event.AsyncDispatcher$1.run(AsyncDispatcher.java:162)\r\n    at java.lang.Thread.run(Thread.java:750) {code}\r\nThis leads to Maven Surefire reporting a forked VM crash:\r\n{code:java}\r\norg.apache.maven.surefire.booter.SurefireBooterForkException: ExecutionException The forked VM terminated without properly saying goodbye. VM crash or System.exit called?\r\nProcess Exit Code: 255\r\nCrashed tests: org.apache.hadoop.yarn.server.resourcemanager.TestAppManager {code}",
    "commits": [
      {
        "sha": "e934ce323eb8ba9bcabd6c1feebfe2006ba32e73",
        "message": "YARN-11876. Fix AsyncDispatcher crash in TestAppManager.",
        "author": "slfan1989",
        "date": "2025-10-07T16:23:38Z",
        "files": [
          {
            "PARENT_PATH": "hadoop-yarn-project/hadoop-yarn/hadoop-yarn-server/hadoop-yarn-server-resourcemanager/src/test/java/org/apache/hadoop/yarn/server/resourcemanager/TestAppManager.java",
            "CHILD_PATH": "hadoop-yarn-project/hadoop-yarn/hadoop-yarn-server/hadoop-yarn-server-resourcemanager/src/test/java/org/apache/hadoop/yarn/server/resourcemanager/TestAppManager.java",
            "PATH_CHANGED": false,
            "LINES_ADDED": 3,
            "LINES_DELETED": 3,
            "PARENT_LOC": 2126,
            "STATUS": "M"
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "sha_before": "d9c33088628d7146664ba97e4ef5f196b5f12d15",
